---
Output valid JSON only (omit fields that do not apply):
- "operation": required
- "concept": for cluster — human-readable name of the concept to cluster by (e.g. "environmental vs human dominance"); omit for free HDBSCAN
- "concept_space": for cluster with concept — "semantic" (text-based themes) or "visual" (visual style/tone); default "semantic"
- "concept_positive_descriptions": for cluster with concept — array of exactly 3 full sentences describing films that strongly embody the HIGH end of the concept axis
- "concept_negative_descriptions": for cluster with concept — array of exactly 3 full sentences describing films that strongly embody the LOW end of the concept axis
- "concept_positive_label": for cluster with concept — short label for the high end (2–4 words, e.g. "nature-dominant")
- "concept_negative_label": for cluster with concept — short label for the low end (2–4 words, e.g. "human-dominant")
- "target_cluster_label": for cluster/focus/exclude — exact label of the target cluster; omit to operate on the full catalogue
- "cluster_a_label": for merge — label of the first cluster
- "cluster_b_label": for merge — label of the second cluster
- "merged_label": for merge — desired label for the merged result
- "genres": for cross_filter — list of genre strings (OR logic)
- "release_year_min": for cross_filter — earliest year inclusive
- "release_year_max": for cross_filter — latest year inclusive
- "director": for cross_filter — director name substring
- "filtered_cluster_label": for cross_filter — short label for the filtered result
